sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  box rgba(255, 244, 229, 0.55) 测试计划
    actor U as 用户 / Agent
    participant P as PQL
    participant TC as Testing Packages Compiler
  end

  box rgba(231, 246, 243, 0.62) Talos 控制面
    participant N as NyxID
    participant T as Talos Testing Tool
    participant S as Talos Scheduler
    participant A as Hosted Authorization Authority<br/>Decision pending
    participant W as talos-worker
  end

  box rgba(234, 246, 232, 0.62) 本地执行面
    participant R as Local QA Runtime
    participant TR as Testing Packages Runner
    participant B as Browser Executor
  end

  U->>P: 提出测试目标
  P->>P: 生成 ProjectPackSnapshot / TestSelection
  P->>TC: approved TestSelection / InputSet
  TC-->>P: StructuredPlan ref / digest
  P->>P: 冻结 Source / Plan / Runner Package / Environment provenance

  P->>N: TestingToolClient.get_capabilities
  N->>T: 转发 capability 查询
  T-->>N: execution profile / runtime / backend / limits
  N-->>P: bounded capabilities

  P->>N: TestingToolClient.submit<br/>refs / digests / policy
  N->>T: identity / route / transport approval
  T->>S: 验证 placement policy / exact input tuple<br/>pool visibility / eligible machine capacity
  S-->>T: placement eligibility accepted
  T->>T: 幂等创建 QARun

  W->>T: outbound claim<br/>worker / machine capability
  T->>S: 为 claiming machine 创建 TestingAttempt
  S->>S: 原子占用 testing slot<br/>创建 reservation / lease / generation / fence
  S-->>T: reservation + exact attempt binding
  T->>A: 请求 operation-specific authorization
  A-->>T: LocalQARequestAuthorization ref / digest
  T-->>W: TestingTask + lease/fence + authorization
  W->>T: heartbeat

  W->>R: getCapabilities
  R-->>W: runtime profile / backend / runner packages / limits
  W->>W: 校验 Runtime capability<br/>和 package id/version/digest
  W->>R: LocalQARuntimeAdapter.submitRun<br/>exact source/plan/package + authorization
  R->>R: local admission / digest / current claim / fence
  R-->>W: RunAcceptance + initial Snapshot
  W->>T: local_accept

  R->>TR: 加载匹配版本 Runner
  loop 确定性执行冻结 StructuredPlan
    TR-->>R: typed BrowserAction
    R->>B: 执行 BrowserAction
    B-->>R: bounded Observation
    R->>TR: Observation
    TR-->>R: AssertionResult / CaseResult
  end

  R->>R: Evidence + CleanupReceipt
  R-->>W: CaseResultSet / Evidence refs / Cleanup refs
  W->>T: bounded terminal execution facts
  T->>T: 更新 QARun snapshot / events

  loop 直到 QARun terminal
    P->>N: get / events
    N->>T: 转发查询
    T-->>N: snapshot/events + result refs/digests
    N-->>P: bounded response
  end

  P->>P: 保存 TestingRunRecord
  P->>P: 校验 CaseResult / Evidence / Cleanup 完整性
  P-->>U: 展示执行结果和 Evidence refs

  Note over P,TC: PQL 使用 Compiler；Compiler 只生成冻结 StructuredPlan
  Note over R,TR: Runtime 加载 Runner；Runner 负责 Action / Observation / Assertion / CaseResult
  Note over P,R: PQL 不直连 Runtime；Testing Packages 不是网络转发服务
  Note over N,T: NyxID 只负责身份、路由和传输审计；Talos Testing Tool 负责 QARun
  Note over S,W: submit 先验证 placement；claim 时为该 worker/machine 原子 reservation 并绑定 attempt
  Note over R,B: Runtime 拥有本地 Browser effect、Evidence 和 Cleanup
